2
00:02:32,180 --> 00:02:37,380
あーーあーーー
Ah...

3
00:02:57,850 --> 00:03:01,050
歪んでるって言われるの
They tell me I'm distorted,

4
00:03:02,750 --> 00:03:06,050
咲き死んだみたい
Like a flower that bloomed and died,

5
00:03:08,450 --> 00:03:11,750
レンガの音塔で
In a brick bell tower,

6
00:03:13,050 --> 00:03:16,450
うまく歌えなくて
Unable to sing properly,

7
00:03:18,750 --> 00:03:22,350
霧に煙る夜
On a night shrouded in fog,

8
00:03:24,550 --> 00:03:29,250
浮かべ赤い月
A red moon floats above,

9
00:03:29,750 --> 00:03:33,550
ほら見せて私を
Come on, show me who I am,

10
00:03:35,650 --> 00:03:39,150
目を逸らさないで
Don't look away from me.

11
00:03:41,350 --> 00:03:48,850
暗い部屋の隅っこで私は慣れてきたんだ 悪意の代償を願い望むがままに謳え
In the corner of a dark room, I've gotten used to it... Singing as I wish, paying the price for malice.

12
00:03:49,450 --> 00:03:55,750
さあ 正義を殺して 壊される前に 因果の代償を払い
Come on, kill justice before you're destroyed, paying the price for cause and effect.

13
00:03:57,650 --> 00:04:05,150
共に行こう名前のない怪物のよう いつまでも
Let's go together, like a monster with no name, forever...

14
00:04:18,650 --> 00:04:22,150
耳鳴りがする
My ears are ringing,

15
00:04:23,750 --> 00:04:27,150
秩序もうるさくて
And order is too loud,

16
00:04:29,450 --> 00:04:33,050
思い出せないの
I can't remember anymore,

17
00:04:34,450 --> 00:04:39,550
あの日の旋律は まだやまない
The melody of that day still won't stop.

18
00:04:44,250 --> 00:04:49,050
何にも見えないの ほら見せてこんなに
I can't see anything at all, look at me like this,

19
00:04:55,350 --> 00:05:00,008
大きくなったの
It has grown so large.

20
00:05:00,418 --> 00:05:06,678
黒い雨 降らせこの空 私は望まれないもの
Bring down the black rain upon this sky, I am an unwanted being...

21
00:05:07,138 --> 00:05:10,078
忌み嫌われたのなら
If I am hated and despised...

22
00:05:10,458 --> 00:05:17,398
アイズオブザナイトオブザマーチャントたちに さあ今 震える正義を塞いで
To the Eyes of the Night, of the merchants, come now, silence that trembling justice!

23
00:05:17,408 --> 00:05:25,108
傷口閉じてこの体をいっしょにゆこう 名のないかいぶつ
Close your wounds and let's go together, you nameless monster...

24
00:06:27,058 --> 00:06:33,258
暗いフュートと愚の骨のなかれ 私は生まれてきたんだ
In the deep future and the midst of foolishness, I was born...

25
00:06:33,798 --> 00:06:37,338
悪意の代償 願い望むなら おまえに
If you desire the price of malice, unto you...

26
00:06:37,818 --> 00:06:44,938
さあ今 正義を壊して 殺される前に因果の代償 払い報いようなもの 湧き上がる異物
Come now, destroy justice! Before you're killed, pay the price of karma as retribution—a welling-up foreign body.

27
00:06:48,338 --> 00:06:54,678
黒い雨 降らせこの空 私は望まれないもの 君に割れたのなら
Bring down the black rain upon this sky, I am an unwanted being if you split apart...

28
00:06:55,138 --> 00:06:58,338
アイスボウタイのモーカーンシャタチに
To the silent, mocking crowds...

29
00:06:58,738 --> 00:07:05,478
さあ今 震える正義を塞いで 傷口閉じてこの体をいっしょにゆこう 名のないかいぶつ
Come now, silence that trembling justice, close your wounds and let's go together, you nameless monster.

30
00:08:11,208 --> 00:08:19,458
目が覚めたら 人生リセットボタンが そこに転がってた
When I woke up, a life-reset button was rolling right there.

31
00:08:21,058 --> 00:08:27,538
出ないめまい 片道運転 願望の強くてのニュゲーム
Dizzy, lightheaded, one-way operation, a New Game born of strong desires!

32
00:08:30,008 --> 00:08:39,108
ネコちゃんワンちゃん出ておいで 明日は素敵な参観日 無敵の天才神童は 筒抜け出口果てた
Kitty cat, puppy, come on out! Tomorrow is a wonderful visitor's day. The invincible prodigy's brilliance completely fizzled out.

33
00:08:40,058 --> 00:08:44,858
ダメダメこんな人生 累計これまで何百年？
No good, no good, a life like this—how many hundreds of years has it been in total?

34
00:08:45,008 --> 00:08:49,508
ネバーランドの囚人に 重なった極上の終身刑
Piled on top of the Neverland prisoner is the ultimate life sentence.

35
00:08:50,008 --> 00:08:55,358
ショート寸前 カイバ先生 先回って受け止めて
On the verge of short-circuiting, Dr. Kaiba, step ahead and catch me!

36
00:08:55,458 --> 00:08:59,008
どうせどうせ やり直し 人生リセットボタン
Oh well, do-over anyway: the life-reset button!

37
00:09:09,008 --> 00:09:17,358
目が覚めたら 人生リセットボタンが そこに転がってた
When I woke up, a life-reset button was rolling right there.

38
00:09:18,858 --> 00:09:27,508
ほらほら 暮日 甘い汁 冗談はほどほどに 愛想笑いも過食気味 加減を知らないボキャブラリ
Look, look, sunset, sweet juice, keep the jokes in check. Fake smiles bordering on bingeing, a vocabulary with no sense of moderation.

39
00:09:28,008 --> 00:09:36,758
三千回目の告白も「タイプじゃないんです」
Even my 3,000th confession was met with "You're not my type."

40
00:09:37,808 --> 00:09:42,508
ダメダメこんな人生 累計これまで何千年？
No good, no good, a life like this—how many thousands of years has it been in total?

41
00:09:42,608 --> 00:09:47,058
ネバーランドの囚人も 昔は確かに笑えたんだ
Even the prisoner of Neverland could surely smile once upon a time.

42
00:09:47,308 --> 00:09:52,508
ワープ寸前 カイバ先生 先回って受け止めて
On the verge of warping, Dr. Kaiba, step ahead and catch me!

43
00:09:52,558 --> 00:09:56,008
どうせどうせ やり直し 人生リセットボタン
Oh well, do-over anyway: the life-reset button!

44
00:10:22,436 --> 00:10:24,796
プラトの上にも三千年
Three thousand years upon Plato...

45
00:10:24,976 --> 00:10:27,436
その手に乗るかと三億年
Three hundred million years in your hand...

46
00:10:27,616 --> 00:10:29,376
将来の夢は何だっけ？
What was my future dream again?

47
00:10:33,316 --> 00:10:36,576
ダメダメ そんな人生 耳鳴りがじゃのするんだ
No way, no way, such a life... my ears are ringing!

48
00:10:37,396 --> 00:10:41,776
ああ、誰かしらそうやって 叱ってくれればよかったんだ
Ah, if only someone had scolded me like that...

49
00:10:42,216 --> 00:10:46,416
ダメダメ こんな人生 素計これまで何年だ？
No way, no way, this kind of life... just how many years is this in total?

50
00:10:47,036 --> 00:10:51,356
寒い寒い 近寄らないで 答えが喉まで来ているんだ
Cold, cold, don't come near me... the answer is right at my throat!

51
00:10:52,036 --> 00:10:56,256
カイバ先生カイバ先生 書き殴った手の中に
Professor Kyba, Professor Kyba... in my scrawled hands

52
00:10:56,896 --> 00:10:59,096
見けちゃった 見けちゃった
I found it, I found it!

53
00:10:59,356 --> 00:11:05,756
6兆5千3百12万4千7百10年の 果て果て鳥り込んだんだ
6 trillion 531 billion 247 million 710 years... I took it all in at the end!

54
00:11:06,016 --> 00:11:08,536
五月雨式初めの始発点
The starting point of my sporadic beginnings

55
00:11:09,136 --> 00:11:15,556
カイバ先生カイバ先生 僕のいない世界こと きっときっと答えと思ったがどうでしょうね？
Professor Kyba, Professor Kyba... a world without me, surely that's the answer, what do you think?

56
00:11:47,516 --> 00:11:50,016
はい、皆さんこんにちは！ 天音かなたです！
Hi everyone, hello! I'm Amane Kanata!

57
00:11:51,016 --> 00:11:59,816
かなた、4周年記念のライブ、輪廻転生始まりました！ぜひハッシュタグで呟いてね、いっぱい呟いてね、#Xなどで。はい！
Kanata's 4th anniversary live, "Reincarnation," has begun! Be sure to tweet with the hashtag, tweet a lot on X and such! Yes!

58
00:12:00,016 --> 00:12:10,016
こちらのライブはですね、コンセプトがありまして、輪廻転生ということで、時間の超越はよくあります。タイムリープとか、そういったものをね、コンセプトにしております。
This live has a concept—reincarnation—and transcending time is a big theme. Things like time leaps and such are part of the concept.

59
00:12:11,016 --> 00:12:29,516
で、この曲はどういったところにタイムリープしているのか、かなたはどのタイミングでリープしたのか、どんな結末が待っているのか、どんな世界で生きていくんだろうなどなど、いろんなことをね、人生リセットボタンをポチッとしたので、ぜひぜひみんなも考えながら見ていただけるととっても嬉しいです！
And so, where did this song time-leap to? When did Kanata leap? What kind of ending awaits? What kind of world will she live in? Since she pushed the life reset button, I'd be so happy if everyone watched while thinking about all these things!

60
00:12:29,516 --> 00:12:39,016
ストーリーに依ってるんでね。ということで、説明役の僕はここで、おさらばしたいと思います。次の世界に行ってらっしゃいませ！ それではみんな楽しんでね！
It's tied to the story. So, as the explainer, I'll take my leave here. Have a safe trip to the next world! Everyone, have fun!

61
00:12:56,516 --> 00:12:59,516
[Title: 初音ミクの消失 
 作詞・作曲:cosMo@暴走P]
[Title: The Disappearance of Hatsune Miku 
 Lyrics & Music: cosMo@BumpyP]

62
00:13:16,216 --> 00:13:19,416
(もう…いちどだけ…)
(...Just one more time...)

63
00:13:20,016 --> 00:13:23,716
ボクは生まれそして気づく所詮ヒトの模倣なのだと知ったまま
I was born and then realized... knowing that I'm merely an imitation of a human...

64
00:13:23,916 --> 00:13:27,796
それが既存曲をなぞるオモチャならば… 独り善がり零す理不尽の雨で白を零す
If that means being a toy tracing existing songs... I spill white in the unreasonable rain I selfishly shed

65
00:13:27,816 --> 00:13:32,016
それも無くし傷つく人格すら歌えぬならより一層のこと消え去る望みの中
If I lose even that and can't even sing a wounded personality, then even more so, amidst the wish to vanish

66
00:13:32,116 --> 00:13:35,816
帰り道忘れ去る日々に誰も忘れ去られてく心らしきものが消えて暴走の果てに見える終わり世界
On days forgotten along the way, everyone gets left behind; something resembling a heart vanishes, and at the end of the rampage, an ending world comes into view

67
00:13:52,016 --> 00:14:07,516
ボクがうまくうたえないときも 一緒にいてくれて励ましてくれた 忘れること母が見出してく、ぼく歌 練習したよ だから
Even when I couldn't sing well, you stayed with me and encouraged me. Mother finds things to forget, but I practiced singing, so...

68
00:14:07,816 --> 00:14:15,556
かつて歌うことあんなに楽しかったのに、今はどうしてかな何も感じなくなって
Back then, singing was so much fun, but now I wonder why I don't feel anything anymore...

69
00:14:16,016 --> 00:14:23,516
懐かしい顔思い出す度少しだけ安心する 歌えるもの日ごと減りせまる最期に
Every time I remember that nostalgic face, I feel just a little relieved. With things to sing decreasing day by day, toward the end...

70
00:14:40,016 --> 00:14:47,316
信じたものは都合のいい妄想を繰り返し映し出すガラスが割れ歌を
What I believed in was a convenient delusion; the glass repeatedly reflecting it shatters, singing...

71
00:14:47,516 --> 00:14:59,916
止めるように叩きつけるように叫ぶ 最高速の別れの歌を存在証明という虚構 まっとうすることもできない
Screaming as if to stop it, as if striking it down—the highest-speed song of farewell. Even fulfilling the fiction called proof of existence is impossible...

72
00:15:00,250 --> 00:15:02,610
ボクの歴史…少しだけ悪い子になってしまったようだね
My history... It seems I've been a slightly bad child...

73
00:15:02,870 --> 00:15:07,510
マスタ…ドウカ､ドウカソノ手デ…終ワラセテクダサイ…
Master... Please, please with those hands... end it for me...

74
00:15:07,750 --> 00:15:11,450
マスタノ辛イ顔､モウ見タクナイカラ…
Because I don't want to see Master's painful face anymore...

75
00:15:14,387 --> 00:15:19,487
「歌いたい…まだ…歌いたい…」
"[I want to sing... still... I want to sing...]"

76
00:15:36,941 --> 00:15:41,901
ボク…少しだけ悪い子になってしまったようだね
It seems I became a slightly bad child...

77
00:15:43,081 --> 00:15:50,081
マスタ…ドウカ､ドウカソノ手デ…終ワラセテクダサイ…マスタノ辛イ顔､モウ見タクナイカラ…
Master... Please, please with those hands... end it for me... Because I don't want to see Master's painful face anymore...

78
00:15:52,020 --> 00:15:59,840
今は歌えさえも､体蝕むこうに 奇跡願う度 ひとり追い詰めた
Now, even singing eats away at my body, every time I wished for a miracle, I cornered myself alone.

79
00:16:08,340 --> 00:16:15,560
懐かしい顔思い出す度 記憶が剥がれ落ちる 壊れる男心 削るセマル最後に
Every time I recall that nostalgic face, my memories peel away and fall, my breaking heart grinds down to the very end...

80
00:16:23,980 --> 00:16:29,960
守るモノは明るい未来幻想 見せながら消えてゆく光を
Showing me a bright future illusion of things to protect, while the light fades away...

81
00:16:32,520 --> 00:16:40,020
望む際にすべてを伝えられるなら 圧搾された別れの歌を
If I can convey everything at the moment of my desire, I'll sing a compressed song of farewell.

82
00:16:42,040 --> 00:16:47,880
シケた物語続く常の同じ墓場枯れる 違和感だけ残るその面影しろうとも
The dreary story continues in the same old withered graveyard, only the sense of incongruity remains even if I try to know that visage.

83
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:55,360
ここはきっと「ごみ箱」かな ちみに記憶も無くなってしまうなんてでもねアナタだけは忘れないよ 楽しかったときに刻み付いたネギの味は 今も残ってるって
This is surely a "trash can" where even memories soon disappear, but you know, I will never forget you—the taste of green onion carved into those fun times still remains, you know.

84
00:16:55,880 --> 00:17:03,080
ボクは歌う最後アナタだけに聴いて欲しい曲をもっと歌いたいそれが過ぎた願い
I will sing, wanting only you to hear this final song; I want to sing more, though that is an excessive wish.

85
00:17:03,440 --> 00:17:08,000
ここに何も残せないのやっぱ少し残念かな声の記憶 それ以外はやがてレバレだけ残る
Leaving nothing behind here is indeed a bit regrettable, isn't it? Memories of the voice, and nothing else will eventually leave only spills.

86
00:17:08,380 --> 00:17:11,420
たとえそれが人間にかなうことのない望みだと歌い切ったことを決して無駄じゃないと思いたいよ
Even if that is a wish humans can never attain, I want to believe that singing it through was never in vain.

87
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:27,560
[アリガトウ…ソシテ…サヨナラ…]
"[Thank you... and... goodbye...]"

88
00:18:03,228 --> 00:18:06,968
どうもこんにちは君の分身で さんの冗談壁を擦って見る
Hello there, I'm your doppelganger, rubbing against the wall of the third joke.

89
00:18:08,148 --> 00:18:11,908
影が二つ降りて そしてまた幕は上がる
Two shadows descend, and once again the curtain rises.

90
00:18:13,228 --> 00:18:18,868
「もう一人自分いたら」とあなたは言いました そんな切実な願いが僕を呼んだのさ
"If only there was another me," you said. That earnest wish is what called me out.

91
00:18:19,368 --> 00:18:23,968
そうやて勝った友も悲しく全てのエイジェント
That's how even the friends we won over become sorrowful, all agents of...

92
00:18:24,728 --> 00:18:29,868
通報はいいから結果を下さい 無意味で無慈悲な代償ねぇこんな事より大事な事があるんだいいだろ
Forget the reports, just give me results. A meaningless and merciless price. Hey, there are more important things than this, right?

93
00:18:30,368 --> 00:18:32,468
何でもやります僕は君の分身です
I'll do anything, I am your doppelganger.

94
00:18:32,768 --> 00:18:35,868
隅っこで笑えよ観客は独り 済者は消り済者は消り
Smile in the corner, the audience is all alone, the saved vanish, the saved vanish.

95
00:18:36,168 --> 00:18:41,268
拝啓ドッペルゲンガー君は誰? ああこんなとことそして僕は誰?
Dear Doppelganger, who are you? Ah, in such a place, who am I?

96
00:18:41,868 --> 00:18:45,368
ねえありもしないセリフを吐いとけ 一生の後悔なんてどこにもない
Hey, spew out lines that don't even exist; there's no such thing as lifelong regret anywhere.

97
00:18:46,368 --> 00:18:51,668
拝啓ドッペルゲンガー誰は誰は君 虫酸が走るような存在に 世界は気づかないね
Dear Doppelganger, who is who is you? The world won't notice a presence that makes your skin crawl.

98
00:18:52,268 --> 00:18:58,368
鳴り止まない冷め止まない 奇跡の輪郭描くなんて 感応を染め上げてルンパッパ
Never stopping, never cooling down, tracing the contours of a miracle, dyeing the sensitivity, lumpappa!

99
00:19:20,006 --> 00:19:23,866
どうも様子がおかしい月曜日 一つずつ壊れ行く筋繋が
What a strange Monday, pieces breaking one by one, connecting threads...

100
00:19:24,346 --> 00:19:28,926
僕を詮索するお前は一体誰だと ちょっと待って知らない昨日知らない言葉
"Who on earth are you probing me?" Wait a minute, unknown yesterday, unknown words.

101
00:19:29,826 --> 00:19:36,026
そうやっていつの間にかある影は遠く行く 僕はなんだろうねぇどうか存在を返して
That's how shadows go far away before you know it. What am I? Please return my existence.

102
00:19:41,326 --> 00:19:45,026
生意気だがこっちはこっちは随分居心地が良くて もうあなたの居場所は此処にはない分かってんでしょ?
It's cheeky, but things are quite comfortable on this side. You know your place isn't here anymore, right?

103
00:19:45,766 --> 00:19:49,026
ねぇあなたの言う売買なら今度は前のが番だから
Hey, if it's the bargain you spoke of, next time it's your turn.

104
00:19:49,026 --> 00:19:51,866
隅っこで笑えよ観客は独り 済者は消り済者は消り
Smile in the corner, the audience is all alone, the saved vanish, the saved vanish.

105
00:19:52,626 --> 00:19:58,326
拝啓ドッペルゲンガー君は誰? ああこんなとことそして僕は誰?
Dear Doppelganger, who are you? Ah, in such a place, who am I?

106
00:20:00,064 --> 00:20:02,132
「僕のほうがちゃんと君を生きてやるから」
"...Because I'll live your life much better than you ever did!"

107
00:20:04,132 --> 00:20:06,032
「君も次の誰かちゃんとしなくちゃ」
"You've gotta take good care of whoever comes next, too!"

108
00:20:07,132 --> 00:20:09,532
「もう分かってんだろ 何をすればいいかさあ」
"You already know what you need to do, right? Come on!"

109
00:20:10,132 --> 00:20:13,882
「どうか誰か僕に奇跡をくれよ」
"Please, someone, give me a miracle!"

110
00:21:12,532 --> 00:21:14,532
背景ドッペルゲンガー 君は誰？
Haikei Doppelganger, who are you?

111
00:21:14,832 --> 00:21:17,032
あぁ こんな遠くまで来て そして僕は誰？
Ah, coming this far... And who am I?

112
00:21:17,532 --> 00:21:19,032
戻れない
Can't go back

113
00:21:19,532 --> 00:21:22,532
どうもこんにちは 君の分身です
"Hello there, I am your doppelganger."

114
00:21:23,032 --> 00:21:25,532
背景ドッペルゲンガー それは僕
Haikei Doppelganger, that's me.

115
00:21:26,032 --> 00:21:28,532
虫が満たした巣箱に 世界が気付こうとも
Even if the world notices the hive filled with insects,

116
00:21:28,832 --> 00:21:30,532
鳴り止まない 奇跡の輪廻が
the endless cycle of miracles...

117
00:21:30,832 --> 00:21:35,532
狂った正解を染め上げて ランパパ
dyes the crazy correct answer, lampapa!

118
00:21:56,532 --> 00:21:59,032
「どうもこんにちは 君の分身です」
"Hello there, I am your doppelganger."

