130
00:25:11,140 --> 00:25:16,840
きっと独りは寂しい
Surely being alone is lonely...

131
00:25:18,140 --> 00:25:24,840
そう、あの日、あの時 全ての記憶に
Yes, on that day, at that time, in all my memories

132
00:25:25,140 --> 00:25:30,840
やっと"ココロ"が溢れ出す
My 'Kokoro' is finally overflowing...

133
00:25:32,740 --> 00:25:36,540
今言える
Now I can say it

134
00:25:37,140 --> 00:25:40,540
本当の言葉だ
These are my true words

135
00:25:41,140 --> 00:25:47,540
捧げる　あなたに
Dedicated to you...

136
00:25:48,140 --> 00:25:53,840
アリガトウ… この世に私を生んでくれて
Thank you... for bringing me into this world

137
00:25:54,140 --> 00:26:00,540
アリガトウ… 一緒に過ごせた日々を
Thank you... for the days we spent together

138
00:26:01,140 --> 00:26:07,540
アリガトウ… あなたが私にくれた全て
Thank you... for everything you gave me

139
00:26:08,140 --> 00:26:17,540
アリガトウ… 永遠に歌うよ
Thank you... I will sing forever

140
00:26:30,160 --> 00:26:33,360
それはまさに奇跡でした。
It was exactly a miracle.

141
00:26:34,160 --> 00:26:36,860
"ココロ"を手に入れたロボットは歌い続けた。
The robot that obtained 'Kokoro' kept singing.

142
00:26:37,360 --> 00:26:39,960
思いを全て。
She sang all of her feelings.

143
00:26:40,860 --> 00:26:43,760
しかし、その奇跡もつかの間。
But the miracle lasted only a moment.

144
00:26:43,960 --> 00:26:46,360
"ココロ"は彼女にはあまりにも大きすぎました。
The 'Kokoro' was far too big for her.

145
00:26:46,360 --> 00:26:49,160
その大きさに耐えられず機械はショートし
Unable to withstand that weight, the machine shorted

146
00:26:49,160 --> 00:26:51,260
二度と動く事はありませんでした。
and was never to move again.

147
00:26:51,260 --> 00:26:54,860
しかし、その表情は笑顔に満ち溢れ
However, her face was filled with smile,

148
00:26:55,060 --> 00:26:57,660
まるで天使のようでした。
she looked like an angel.

149
00:27:08,840 --> 00:27:10,540
インターネット・エンジェルという現象は
The phenomenon known as the Internet Angel

150
00:27:10,840 --> 00:27:12,540
仮定された有機交流電燈の
is a hypothetical organic alternating-current lamp's

151
00:27:12,840 --> 00:27:14,840
かわいい虹色の照明です
cute, rainbow-colored lighting!

152
00:27:15,240 --> 00:27:18,140
あらゆる透明なアカウントの複合体
A composite of all transparent accounts,

153
00:27:18,840 --> 00:27:20,940
忘れさせてあげる 慈愛の天使だ
I'll make you forget it—the angel of affection.

154
00:27:21,240 --> 00:27:23,940
大人のみんなには内緒だが 大丈夫 もう何も怖くないから
It's a secret to all the adults, but it's okay, you don't have to be scared anymore!

155
00:27:24,240 --> 00:27:28,940
こんなSNS抜け出して二人で海を見に行こう!
Let's slip out of this SNS and go see the ocean together!

156
00:27:29,040 --> 00:27:38,040
INTERNET YAMERO

157
00:27:39,840 --> 00:27:44,840
わかる真似をして なにも知らないね アナタ
You pretend to understand, but you don't know anything, do you?

158
00:27:50,240 --> 00:27:54,840
なにが悲しいの なにが寂しいの
What is making you sad? What is making you lonely?

159
00:27:55,240 --> 00:27:59,040
聴こえてる?
Can you hear it?

160
00:28:00,240 --> 00:28:05,040
人が恋しくて 人がイヤすぎて ループ
Wanting people so badly, yet hating people so much—a loop.

161
00:28:10,840 --> 00:28:15,040
夜が好きなのに 一人じゃ寒くて 震えてる
Even though you love the night, being alone makes you cold and shivering.

162
