226
00:38:42,256 --> 00:38:45,056
今日何食べた? 好きな本は?
What did you eat today? What's your favorite book?

227
00:38:45,256 --> 00:38:48,056
遊びに行くならどこに行くの?
Where do you go when you go out to play?

228
