I've never seen such a liar.

381
00:54:26,048 --> 00:54:29,068
生まれつきたての素足
Bare feet just born into the world.

382
00:54:29,158 --> 00:54:32,508
This lie is love. And this lie is a gift to the world.

383
00:54:32,698 --> 00:54:35,618
誰と言ったか思い出して
Remember who you said it to,

384
00:54:36,118 --> 00:54:38,028
わたしが命を掛けるから
because I will stake my life on it.

